<title>SPAIN: Spain's Enher 1996 net profit up 21.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Enher 1996 net profit up 21.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity group Enher posted 1996 net profit of 10.13 billion pesetas, up 21.6 percent versus the year earlier, the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Operating costs fell 1.8 percent to 179.31 billion pesetas, and cash flow was up 13 percent to 36.07 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Enher said it would pay an interim dividend against 1996 results of 53 pesetas, up 10.4 percent year on year, effective January 3 1997.</p>
<p>Enher is part of the Endesa group.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
